# project1

A minimal Python project scaffold.

## Setup

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install -e .
```

## Run tests

```bash
python -m pytest -q
```

## Example usage

```python
from project1 import greet

print(greet("World"))
```
